    {
      "id": "87WQmBTLvLvLqMYfb-X1m",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 96.82930654869479,
      "y": 4520,
      "width": 1414.949951171875,
      "height": 1665,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "I7e3L03U2e3akQUfdpjB7",
        "NaUc3PhAMGjbRaiAhqRGY",
        "NFutGAOTXqS7JYDUcjPxH",
        "PTIiNQEPOzmXUobvOG8sY",
        "qGdleh05vwC7Hs2Nn8lpG"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bus",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2030670449,
      "version": 1917,
      "versionNonce": 50009983,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791807081640,
      "created": 1791807059919,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "° Look at the function schema,\n\n° you are going to see a JSON Object per function\n\n° It explains how the function works\n\n° It has : \n    - a name\n    - a description\n    - all the different parameters \n  and \n    - can also tells the Model ( not in this example ) :\n        * what is required, \n        * what is not required\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n° The key thing to note is we are not actually passing the code of the function\n  instead we are passing the description of the function, how to use function\n  what the function returns ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "° Look at the function schema,\n\n° you are going to see a JSON Object per function\n\n° It explains how the function works\n\n° It has : \n    - a name\n    - a description\n    - all the different parameters \n  and \n    - can also tells the Model ( not in this example ) :\n        * what is required, \n        * what is not required\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n° The key thing to note is we are not actually passing the code of the function\n  instead we are passing the description of the function, how to use function\n  what the function returns ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
