      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "text": "° The description is really important \n  because this is what the Model is   \n  going to know when to use or what the\n  function is actually useful for\n\n° When we actually interact with a Model\n  that has this tool available, it will \n  know that it can use this tool to \n  find the current weather for a city",
