      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "text": "° The JSON-language data types are :\n\n    - Object\n\n    - Array\n\n    - Number \n\n    - String\n\n    - Boolean ( value true or false )\n\n    or\n\n    - null ( value null )\n\n\n° All values except objects and arrays \n  are scalar\n\n\n° ",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
